  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 5605.02 Training Topics. The training required pursuant to Res 5605.01 shall contain, at a minimum, a review of current administrative rules, state statutes, and division policies pertaining to the issuance of fire permits.\n\nSource. #8318, EMERGENCY, eff 4-4-05, EXPIRES: 10-1-05; ss by #8441, eff 10-1-05; ss by #10547, eff 3-21-14",
